desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Detected AWS Access Key ID Value"
	title_zh: "检测到Detected AWS Access Key ID Value",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-secrets-detected-aws-access-key-id-value"
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
AWS Access Key ID Value detected. This is a sensitive credential and should not be hardcoded here. Instead, read this value from an environment variable or keep it in a separate, private file.

### 风险类型
硬编码凭据（hardcoded-credentials）

### 影响
代码中直接写入账号、令牌等敏感凭据，泄露后攻击者可直接使用这些凭据访问系统或服务。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-798: Use of Hard-coded Credentials
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除硬编码凭据，改用环境变量、密钥管理服务或安全配置中心，并立即轮换已泄露的凭据。

推荐修复：
Instead, read this value from an environment variable or keep it in a separate, private file.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sample": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-detected-aws-access-key-id-value
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex_not(/(?:\b(A3T[A-Z0-9]|AKIA|AGPA|AROA|AIPA|ANPA|ANVA|ASIA)[A-Z0-9]{16}\b)|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-detected\-aws\-access\-key\-id\-value/, /(?i)example|sample|test|fake/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "Detected AWS Access Key ID Value",
	title_zh: "检测到Detected AWS Access Key ID Value",
	message: "Detected AWS Access Key ID Value",
}
